# Whitelist: this repository is public. It holds only our own work (tooling, installer, Hungarian
# anatomical names and UI, corrections, QA summaries). Never commit the Atlas application, its assets,
# extracted English source text, decompiled code, third-party reference documents, or the Hungarian
# translations of the long catalog texts (definitions, health texts, quizzes): those are tracked in
# the separate private repository (sync-private-texts.sh copies them to ../pack-texts).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/sync-private-texts.sh
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README.hu.md
!/release-policy.json
!/Install-Pack.ps1
!/Install.cmd
!/Restore.cmd
!/structure_rows.json
!/*.py
!/ManagedPatcher/
/ManagedPatcher/*
!/ManagedPatcher/Program.cs
!/ManagedPatcher/ManagedPatcher.csproj
!/corrections/
!/translations/
/translations/*
!/translations/terms_hu.json
!/translations/ui_hu.json
!/corrections/
/corrections/fulltext-approved.json
!/fulltext/
/fulltext/*
!/fulltext/TRANSLATOR-CONTRACT.md
!/quality-review/
/quality-review/*
!/quality-review/reverify/
/quality-review/reverify/*
!/quality-review/reverify/*.py
!/quality-review/name-accuracy/
/quality-review/name-accuracy/*
!/quality-review/name-accuracy/NYITOTT-KERDESEK.csv
!/quality-review/name-accuracy/MERGED-SUMMARY.json
!/quality-review/name-accuracy/REVIEWER-CSV-TRIAGE.json
!/quality-review/name-accuracy/ACCELERATED-AUDIT-CONTRACT.md
__pycache__/
